#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:4 a0879321ae6e4cf9baaf71641af61e88
msgid "Supported sites"
msgstr "支持的站点"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:6 a22904d1e2984a649353d4aad360bc7f
msgid ""
"socid_extractor ships **130+ extraction schemes**. Each scheme targets one "
"page shape — a site's profile HTML, a public JSON API, or an embedded state "
"blob — and maps it onto the standard :doc:`field ontology <ontology>`."
msgstr ""
"socid_extractor 内置 **130+ 种提取方案**\\ 。每种提取方案针对一种页面形态——站点的个人资料页 HTML、公开的 JSON "
"API，或嵌入的状态数据块——并将其映射到标准的 :doc:`字段本体 <ontology>`。"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:11 4e448527d3e2496c922e35b817d6c598
msgid "The full, always-current list"
msgstr "完整且始终最新的列表"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:13 029e2b4d0f8a46f2b90b7c30857896ad
msgid ""
"The canonical list is generated from the test suite into `METHODS.md "
"<https://github.com/soxoj/socid-extractor/blob/master/METHODS.md>`_ — one "
"row per scheme, with a link to the e2e test that exercises it. It is "
"regenerated by ``revision.py`` (see :doc:`development`), so it never drifts "
"from the code."
msgstr ""
"权威列表由测试套件生成到 `METHODS.md <https://github.com/soxoj/socid-"
"extractor/blob/master/METHODS.md>`_——每种提取方案对应一行，并附有指向验证它的端到端测试的链接。该列表由 "
"``revision.py`` 重新生成（见 :doc:`development`），因此它永远不会与代码脱节。"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:19 0850c198ac834ada8c7fc55c7c64163e
msgid "A non-exhaustive sample"
msgstr "非详尽的示例"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:21 1bbc75d18a42432fbafcfc6498f3ba74
msgid ""
"**Major networks:** Facebook (user & group pages), Instagram, VK.com, OK.ru,"
" Reddit, TikTok, Bluesky, Tumblr, Flickr."
msgstr ""
"**主流社交网络：** "
"Facebook（用户页与群组页）、Instagram、VK.com、OK.ru、Reddit、TikTok、Bluesky、Tumblr、Flickr。"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:23 2537c4204bd34e47909ba9a6e9b028bb
msgid ""
"**Google ecosystem:** Google docs/maps contributions (cookies required), "
"Google Play, YouTube."
msgstr "**Google 生态系统：** Google 文档/地图贡献（需要 cookie）、Google Play、YouTube。"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:25 37ba051fab874d1aae4f2b0e3adea2a1
msgid "**Mail.ru:** my.mail.ru user mainpage, photo, video."
msgstr "**Mail.ru：** my.mail.ru 用户主页、照片、视频。"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:26 67e32102ceed4b7dbe81d3b98d3c8907
msgid ""
"**Dev / writing platforms:** GitHub, Stack Overflow (HTML + API), LeetCode, "
"Hashnode, Medium, Substack, Paragraph, WordPress.org, Virgool."
msgstr ""
"**开发/写作平台：** GitHub、Stack Overflow（HTML + "
"API）、LeetCode、Hashnode、Medium、Substack、Paragraph、WordPress.org、Virgool。"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:28 ea8986edce1e4197b0a3a472b0037e71
msgid ""
"**Niche / vertical:** Chess.com, Roblox, MyAnimeList, Scratch, Wikipedia, "
"DailyMotion, SlideShare, Weebly, Calendly, Amazon Author, Boosty, Warpcast "
"(Farcaster), Fragment (TON/Telegram), Rarible, CSSBattle, lnk.bio, Spatial, "
"TwitchTracker, Max."
msgstr ""
"**细分/垂直领域：** "
"Chess.com、Roblox、MyAnimeList、Scratch、Wikipedia、DailyMotion、SlideShare、Weebly、Calendly、Amazon"
" "
"Author、Boosty、Warpcast（Farcaster）、Fragment（TON/Telegram）、Rarible、CSSBattle、lnk.bio、Spatial、TwitchTracker、Max。"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:33 d23300c730794d268ae74039df8aeb16
msgid "Universal detectors"
msgstr "通用检测器"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:35 fce6b6dbf5e64aae98c0650d1b57b74e
msgid ""
"A few schemes are not tied to a single domain. Instead of a hard-coded host "
"list, they match on **engine-specific HTML/JSON markers**, so they work on "
"*any* instance of that engine:"
msgstr ""
"少数提取方案并不绑定到单个域名。它们不依赖硬编码的主机列表，而是匹配 **引擎特定的 HTML/JSON 标记**\\ "
"，因此它们可在该引擎的*任何*实例上工作："

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:39 16761450efeb4b2dac52b1d41dac7de7
msgid "**Discourse** forums"
msgstr "**Discourse** 论坛"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:40 e0f3415baac24e419b8128bb775e63ac
msgid "**MediaWiki / Fandom** wikis"
msgstr "**MediaWiki / Fandom** wiki"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:41 07cb30047d1a4eb0b3e3a6ccc5eea390
msgid "**Mastodon** instances"
msgstr "**Mastodon** 实例"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:43 b0d35ab5e78d40f9b68c1bc68c7b9b42
msgid ""
"Because they detect the platform by its markup rather than its URL, self-"
"hosted and white-label deployments are covered automatically."
msgstr "由于它们通过标记而非 URL 来检测平台，因此自托管和白标部署都会被自动覆盖。"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:47 7f2b849e62244d5592cbf8277def2126
msgid "Beyond the built-ins"
msgstr "内置方案之外"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:49 beca72ba36fd4445a4240bf4de25ed5f
msgid ""
"**No scheme for a site?** The opt-in :doc:`AI fallback <ai-fallback>` can "
"extract ontology fields from pages that no scheme covers, when their server "
"HTML carries real data."
msgstr ""
"**某个站点没有对应的提取方案？** 需显式开启的 :doc:`AI 回退 <ai-fallback>` "
"可以从没有任何提取方案覆盖的页面中提取本体字段，只要其服务器 HTML 携带真实数据。"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:52 bc33f7bfde2b47ed922dbc1223e459a9
msgid ""
"**Private / proprietary sites?** Load your own schemes via :doc:`plugins`."
msgstr "**私有/专有站点？** 通过 :doc:`plugins` 加载你自己的提取方案。"

#: ../../source/supported-sites.rst:53 af8a7b3c49c74cdb85dd4abb89a9b62a
msgid "**Want to add a site to the public set?** See :doc:`adding-a-scheme`."
msgstr "**想把某个站点添加到公开集合中？** 参见 :doc:`adding-a-scheme`。"
